+(* Axiom-stamp instrumentation.                                               *)
+(*                                                                           *)
+(* Every theorem carries a bitmask of the axioms its derivation touched.      *)
+(* A bit is allocated by `new_axiom`, so the three basic axioms get ids        *)
+(* automatically; nothing here knows their names.  An inference counter is     *)
+(* bumped once per primitive-rule invocation so a caller can measure the size *)
